==Description==
The '''CherryBlossom Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 38 of the regular [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,360}} or {{Robux|106}} ({{Robux|90}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|24,220}} or {{Robux|3,322}} ({{Robux|2,806}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''CherryBlossom Nametag''' has dark pink text with a purple outline. Behind the text, there are multiple cherry blossom tree leaves, alongside pink smoke and waves. Multiple leaves fall out of the nametag. The player also has a pink aura behind them, which is accompanied by multiple cherry blossom leaves.

